Kernel API compatibility patch plus an in-kernel DMA-BUF registration helper
and the local GPL-2.0-only stateful H.264 V4L2 M2M frontend in src/mve_v4l2.c.
The legacy /dev/mv500 ABI and vendor MCom-03/DVFS build options are preserved.
Firmware is installed from the same source snapshot as the driver.
The local frontend uses 18 internal DPB/output buffers and checks the firmware
minimum; real Rutube H.264 streams require more than the initial eight.
